abstract: >
  A trilingual (Russian, English, Estonian) collection of humorous,
  Buddhist-cosmological aphorisms about cryptography, DevOps, and the
  quiet life of an engineer. Ten volumes plus a prologue and a Codex
  Zero glossary. Published simultaneously as web site, EPUB, PDF, and
  LLM oracle.
